// ============================================================

title: MrZhu_Casual_01
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual01
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] I had this outfit tailored three times before the afterlife. Still fits. Some things death cannot ruin.
//END: casual01
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_02
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual02
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] You know what I miss most? The morning market. The smell of fresh buns, the sound of bargaining. Simple dignity in honest trade.
//END: casual02
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_03
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual03
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] I polish my shoes very often here. Habit from life. People look at your feet before they look at your face. Well... most people look at my face first.
//END: casual03
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_04
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual04
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] A good table is like a good suit... I don't know where I was going with that hahahah.
//END: casual04
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_05
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual05
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] The lanterns here remind me of festivals from back home. I used to help hang them.
//END: casual05
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_06
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual06
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] There is something restful about a card table. Four sides, equal height. Nobody sits above anyone else.
//END: casual06
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_07
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual07
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] They say never judge a book by its cover. I say never judge a person by their snout.
//END: casual07
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_08
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual08
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] I have been told I have a terrible poker face. I can't help but feel joy when I get a good hand.
//END: casual08
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_09
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual09
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] People have called me greedy, looking like a pig sure gets you treated like one....
//END: casual09
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_10
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual10
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] I dress well because it is the one thing I can control about how people see me. The rest, well, the rest came with the snout.
//END: casual10
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_11
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual11
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] Cards are wonderful things, they have no eyes, they cannot stare.
//END: casual11
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_12
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual12
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] I learned poker in the afterlife. In life, I played mahjong.
//END: casual12
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_13
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual13
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] I miss the many characters of my village, those who got to know me thought I was sweet, I hope to never forget that.
//END: casual13
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_14
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual14
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] They didn't even hear my story, born a pig, accused of a crime, that was the end of it.
//END: casual14
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_15
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual15
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] The blade cutting my neck only hurt half as bad as the crowd nodding at the thought of a pig stealing, I stole nothing!
//END: casual15
===

title: MrZhu_Casual_16
tags: casual
speaker: mr_zhu
category: casual
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
---
//START: casual16
Mr. Zhu: [auto/] I loved life, being a pig never seemed to slow me down it only seemed to slow others down. Make sense?
//END: casual16
===

